        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>GITTITE</strong> a native of the Philistine city of Gath (Joshua 13:3). Obed-edom, in whose house the ark was placed, is so designated (2 Samuel 6:10). Six hundred Gittites came with David from Gath into Israel (15:18, 19).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
