        "Dictionary",
        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>MADMANNAH</strong> dunghill, the modern el-Minyay, 15 miles south-south-west of Gaza (Joshua 15:31; 1 Chronicles 2:49), in the south of Judah. The Pal. Mem., however, suggest Umm Deimneh, 12 miles north-east of Beersheba, as the site.",
